### 1. Blob WORM evidence put (legal hold / immutability policy)

Paste in the Sovereign Console browser console:

```js
// Evidence bytes -> WORM container under legal hold.
// Wire: PUT /{{ r.blob_container }}/evidence-{{ r.bates }}.bin (8443);
// overwrites are refused 409 ContainerLocked
// (lib/smalt/data_plane/blob_storage.ex:273 worm_blocked?/3).
await smaltFetch("/{{ r.blob_container }}/evidence-{{ r.bates }}.bin", {
  method: "PUT",
  body: evidenceBytes,                     // the collected artifact
  headers: { "x-ms-blob-type": "BlockBlob" },
});
// Container legal-hold face (set it before the put):
//   GET/PUT /{{ r.blob_container }}?comp=legalhold&legalhold=true
//   (lib/smalt/egress_router.ex:67-68 @container_put_comps/@container_get_comps)
```

### 2. Cosmos ETag-CAS custody document

```js
// Custody record in Cosmos; every mutation is ETag-CAS'd —
// lib/smalt/data_plane/cosmos.ex:133 (quoted etag = sha256 of record).
const custody = await smaltFetch(
  "/dbs/lexdb/colls/{{ r.matter_id }}/docs", {
    method: "POST",
    body: JSON.stringify({
      id: "{{ r.cosmos_doc_id }}",
      bates: "{{ r.bates }}",
      custodian: "{{ r.custodian }}",
      blobContainer: "{{ r.blob_container }}",
      blobPath: "/{{ r.blob_container }}/evidence-{{ r.bates }}.bin",
    }),
  });
// Subsequent custody edits MUST carry If-Match: <etag> — a lost race
// returns 412 and the custody chain stays append-consistent.
```

